{"id":"entrega","lemma":"entrega","pos":"noun","rank":1673,"glosses":["delivery, handover","submission","installment"],"ipa":"/enˈtɾeɡa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"entregas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-entrega.wav","examples":[{"text":"Entrega tus papeles.","en":"Hand in your papers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68668","words":[null,{"g":"your"},{"g":"paper","l":"papel"}]},{"text":"Espero una entrega.","en":"I'm expecting a shipment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703112","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"El sol entrega luz y calor.","en":"The sun gives light and heat.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"sun"},null,{"g":"light"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"heat"}]},{"text":"¿Cuánto tengo que esperar para la entrega?","en":"How long do I have to wait for delivery?","words":[{"g":"how much"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to hope"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Una ampolleta entrega luz.","en":"A light bulb gives light.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"light"}]}]}